{"id": "46943", "title": "爱情不在服务区", "author": "林夕", "category": "都市言情", "count": 36, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/46/46943.htm", "intro": "和大多数作家不同，林夕不愿将爱情和现实的割裂开来，她更愿将两者置身在同一境地，在爱情和现实的纠缠不清中，直逼都市人的心灵。有一点残酷，也有一点冷漠，然而更接近人心灵的真实，同时作者对爱的理解和本质的揭示也逐渐呈现在读者面前，那就是爱在俗世之中也依然应保持其纯粹、神圣的原生态，否则宁愿放弃、毁灭也在所不惜。", "base": "files/article/html/46/46943", "chapters": [{"title": "正文一", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "6371237.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "6371238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "6371239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "6371240.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "6371241.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "6371242.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "6371243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "6371244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "6371245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "6371246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "6371247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "6371248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文二", "volume": true}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "6371250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "6371251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "6371252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "6371253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "6371254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "6371255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "6371256.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "6371257.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "6371258.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "6371259.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "6371260.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "6371261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "正文三", "volume": true}